WEBVTT

00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:13,410
We hear collagen is to our bones.

00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:16,130
It's like mortar is to bricks.

00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:19,330
Can collagen repair a large cavity?

00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:22,490
What about missing tooth adenous?

00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:26,350
So I think cavity, you're talking about cavity in your teeth.

00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:33,210
No, no, no, it's not gonna repair a large cavity.

00:00:34,010 --> 00:00:36,570
There's a lot of different type of toothpaste

00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:41,570
that uses data-ized, hydroxyapotite microcrystalline,

00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:49,810
hydroxyapotite, which is the type of calcium

00:00:49,810 --> 00:00:51,770
that goes into the tooth and into the bone.

00:00:51,770 --> 00:00:53,930
I actually use that toothpaste

00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:56,850
because my sinus condition,

00:00:56,850 --> 00:01:00,250
I have to breathe through my nose at night and my teeth are out

00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:02,690
and I'm very prone to cavities.

00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:07,690
So since I started using the data-ized micro-micronized

00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:13,050
hydroxyapotite type toothpaste,

00:01:13,050 --> 00:01:18,530
I think you can get it on a,

00:01:18,530 --> 00:01:20,770
I get it on just an Amazon,

00:01:20,770 --> 00:01:22,130
I can't remember the brand,

00:01:22,130 --> 00:01:26,090
no, maybe you think of it before I've done with this call.

00:01:26,090 --> 00:01:28,450
But there's other brands, there's other brands,

00:01:28,450 --> 00:01:31,130
two that use data-ized hydroxyapotite

00:01:32,130 --> 00:01:35,570
in the toothpaste, that might be your best bet.

00:01:35,570 --> 00:01:37,610
Collegiate is gonna be really good

00:01:37,610 --> 00:01:41,770
for your connective tissue.

00:01:41,770 --> 00:01:45,610
Collegiate really isn't gonna build your bones,

00:01:45,610 --> 00:01:49,450
and maybe that's the metaphor here.

00:01:49,450 --> 00:01:53,530
Mortar is to bricks, mortar holds the bricks together.

00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:58,050
Your collagen is gonna help your connective tissue

00:01:58,050 --> 00:01:59,930
that holds the bones together.

00:01:59,930 --> 00:02:01,730
Collegiate is gonna build both.

